---
title: Easy Dumpling Soup
servings: 2
cookTime: 10 min
difficulty: Easy
rating: 4
tags: Pork, Soups
---

Boil the @chicken broth{4%cups}, @soy sauce{4%Tbsp}, and @grated ginger{1%Tbsp} for a few minutes. 

Add the @pork dumplings{12}(frozen). Cook 5 minutes until heated. 

Serve into bowls.
Drizzle with @?sesame oil{1%tsp}, top with @?green onions{1}(sliced),
ground @?Shichimi pepper{}, or other toppings.
